# Delegate to codex

**If the user invoked this skill explicitly ({{command "delegate-codex"}}), always delegate — whatever the task
size. The user chose the harness; do not do the work yourself instead.**

Launch command (step 2 below):

{{if eq .Host "claude"}}    pactify sub run codex --write --worktree --wait 0s --json <<'BRIEF'
    ...complete brief from step 1...
    BRIEF
{{else}}    pactify sub run codex --write --worktree --wait 0s --json --brief-file <brief-file>
{{end}}
For read-only tasks replace `--write` with `--read-only`; never pass both.

